  "days": [
    {
      "day": "Pillar 01",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-6 border border-white/70\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-6 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-white text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase shadow-2xs\" style=\"background-color:#D90429\">Pillar 01</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309]\">Humanity's Representative Heritage</span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-lg sm:text-2xl text-[#2C1210] leading-tight\">UNESCO Cultural Inscription</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">In December 2021, UNESCO officially inscribed 'Durga Puja in Kolkata' on the Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity. Inscribed not merely as a sacred religious observance, but as the world's largest public art installation and an unparalleled celebration of craftsmanship, street gastronomy, and collective unity.</p><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#E5C880]/60 space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309] block\">Cultural Highlights</span><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#2C1210]/80 font-serif\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Inscribed on December 15, 2021, by the UNESCO Intergovernmental Committee in Paris</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Celebrated as a month-long democratic festival embracing all communities without barrier</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Seamlessly synthesizes ancient clay sculpting traditions with avant-garde contemporary art</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#E5C880] shadow-sm group\"><img alt=\"UNESCO Cultural Inscription\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw\" srcset=\"/chronicles/history.jpg?w=256&amp;q=80 256w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=384&amp;q=80 384w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=640&amp;q=80 640w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=750&amp;q=80 750w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=828&amp;q=80 828w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=1080&amp;q=80 1080w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=1200&amp;q=80 1200w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=80 1920w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=2048&amp;q=80 2048w, /chronicles/history.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80 3840w\" src=\"/chronicles/history.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 text-white text-center space-y-0.5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-bold text-xs text-amber-200\">UNESCO Cultural Inscription</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-300 font-serif line-clamp-1\">Historic chronicle of Kolkata's living cultural heritage</p></div></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Pillar 02",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-6 border border-white/70\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-6 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-white text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase shadow-2xs\" style=\"background-color:#D97706\">Pillar 02</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309]\">Breathed into Life from Sacred Ganga Clay</span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-lg sm:text-2xl text-[#2C1210] leading-tight\">Kumartuli &amp; Clay Sculpting Legacy</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">Deep within the labyrinthine riverbank alleys of North Kolkata's Kumartuli, master clay sculptors (Pals) sculpt divine forms from bamboo, straw armature, and holy silt dredged from the river Hooghly. On the sacred dawn of Mahalaya, the ritual of 'Chokkhudaan' (drawing the Devi's omniscient third eye) awakens the Divine Mother.</p><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#E5C880]/60 space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309] block\">Cultural Highlights</span><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#2C1210]/80 font-serif\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Centuries-old artisan quarter along the sacred Hooghly riverbanks</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">100% biodegradable idols crafted from river silt, straw, and natural chalk pigments</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Chokkhudaan ritual performed at dawn on Mahalaya in deep meditative reverence</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#E5C880] shadow-sm group\"><img alt=\"Kumartuli &amp; Clay Sculpting Legacy\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw\" srcset=\"/chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=256&amp;q=80 256w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=384&amp;q=80 384w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=640&amp;q=80 640w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=750&amp;q=80 750w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=828&amp;q=80 828w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=1080&amp;q=80 1080w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=1200&amp;q=80 1200w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=80 1920w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=2048&amp;q=80 2048w, /chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80 3840w\" src=\"/chronicles/kumartuli.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 text-white text-center space-y-0.5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-bold text-xs text-amber-200\">Kumartuli &amp; Clay Sculpting Legacy</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-300 font-serif line-clamp-1\">Master sculptors crafting sacred straw and clay armatures in Kumartuli</p></div></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Pillar 03",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-6 border border-white/70\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-6 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-white text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase shadow-2xs\" style=\"background-color:#9333EA\">Pillar 03</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309]\">Ephemeral Palaces &amp; Motorized Light Gates</span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-lg sm:text-2xl text-[#2C1210] leading-tight\">Pandal Architecture &amp; Illumination</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">For ten days, the metropolis transforms into a colossal public gallery. Master architects erect majestic pandals—some soaring over 100 feet—modeled after world heritage sites or abstract sociopolitical themes using eco-friendly materials like bamboo, cane, and hand-woven jute. By night, Chandannagar's legendary light engineers illuminate the streets with millions of dancing LED tapestries.</p><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#E5C880]/60 space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309] block\">Cultural Highlights</span><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#2C1210]/80 font-serif\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Grand structural feats engineered completely with bamboo poles and coir ropes</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Chandannagar motorized LED light tapestries portraying mythological and contemporary epics</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Sustainable themes utilizing terracotta, brass bells, recycled glass, and handloom fabrics</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#E5C880] shadow-sm group\"><img alt=\"Pandal Architecture &amp; Illumination\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw\" srcset=\"/chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=256&amp;q=80 256w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=384&amp;q=80 384w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=640&amp;q=80 640w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=750&amp;q=80 750w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=828&amp;q=80 828w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=1080&amp;q=80 1080w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=1200&amp;q=80 1200w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=80 1920w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=2048&amp;q=80 2048w, /chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80 3840w\" src=\"/chronicles/pandal_hopping.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 text-white text-center space-y-0.5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-bold text-xs text-amber-200\">Pandal Architecture &amp; Illumination</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-300 font-serif line-clamp-1\">Soaring architectural installations and nighttime festive crowds</p></div></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "day": "Pillar 04",
      "html": "<div class=\"rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] bg-[#FFFBF0] text-[#2C1210] p-3.5 sm:p-6 border border-white/70\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-6 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-white text-[9px] font-mono font-bold uppercase shadow-2xs\" style=\"background-color:#059669\">Pillar 04</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309]\">Where Every Soul Gathers as One</span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif font-black text-lg sm:text-2xl text-[#2C1210] leading-tight\">Inclusivity, Bhog &amp; Sharodotsav</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2C1210]/85 font-serif leading-relaxed\">Sharodotsav transcends every social and religious boundary. Neighborhood 'Para' committees prepare fragrant steaming Khichuri Bhog, Labra, and Payesh, distributed on organic sal-leaf platters to millions of visitors. From midnight street food 'Adda' sessions to morning flower offerings (Pushpanjali), the entire city breathes as a unified family.</p><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#E5C880]/60 space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono font-bold text-[#B45309] block\">Cultural Highlights</span><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-[#2C1210]/80 font-serif\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Universal community dining (Bhog) offered freely to revelers from every walk of life</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Syncretic celebrations where people of every faith, gender, and background participate equally</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#D90429] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm45.66,85.66-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"leading-snug\">Vibrant midnight street-food culture spanning Kathi Rolls, Phuchka, and Sandesh</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#E5C880] shadow-sm group\"><img alt=\"Inclusivity, Bhog &amp; Sharodotsav\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw\" srcset=\"/chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=256&amp;q=80 256w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=384&amp;q=80 384w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=640&amp;q=80 640w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=750&amp;q=80 750w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=828&amp;q=80 828w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=1080&amp;q=80 1080w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=1200&amp;q=80 1200w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=80 1920w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=2048&amp;q=80 2048w, /chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80 3840w\" src=\"/chronicles/street_food.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=80\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 text-white text-center space-y-0.5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-bold text-xs text-amber-200\">Inclusivity, Bhog &amp; Sharodotsav</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-300 font-serif line-clamp-1\">Midnight street food culture, community warmth, and collective joy</p></div></div></div></div>"
    }
  ]
}
